flowchart TB
  input[Legacy scan options: host / platform / arch] --> guard{Profile and arch valid?}
  guard -- no --> rejected[Throw to caller / no completed report]
  guard -- yes --> scan[scanResult: fixed observedAt / sequential adapters]
  scan --> native[nativeCli / Caveat / Throughline / Spotter]
  native -- invalid schema or result --> unknown[Unverified check / product projection]
  native -- valid --> status[Native status projection]
  scan --> deep[Other native and third-party adapters]
  unknown --> compose[Products / revision / report assembly]
  status --> compose
  scan -- collection enabled in legacy path --> runtime[collectRuntimeErrors / ACK candidates]
  runtime --> merge[Server active fingerprint merge / blocked ACK]
  merge --> compose
  compose -- revision failure --> rejected
  compose --> returned[Report and matching ACK bundle to caller]
  current[Ordinary v5-v9 scan] --> empty[Separate current contract: empty ACK list]
  v24[v2 and v4 / sequential native and toolchain diagnostics] --> parsed[Exact product parsers / exit and privacy checks]
  parsed --> diff[Different Caveat parser and arguments / high severity and reason fingerprint]
  diff --> oldreport[Wire-specific report and matching ACK metadata]
  v24 -- collection enabled --> oldruntime[GPT and server external events / v4 adds Lattice]
  oldruntime --> oldreport
  oldreport --> transport[Legacy reporter acceptance then supplied ACK dispatch]
  parsed -- command throw or revision unavailable --> rejected
